Debian's gcc-distro-specs.diff (gcc-14 14.2.0-13, debian/patches), gcc/gcc.cc part,
and the gcc/distro-defaults.h its rules.patch generates for the mips-linux-gnu
cross compiler (gcc-14-cross-mipsen 14.2.0-13cross1): only DIST_DEFAULT_TIMET64,
so the driver adds -D_TIME_BITS=64 -D_FILE_OFFSET_BITS=64 like Debian's.

--- a/gcc/gcc.cc
